# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate using your [IBM Quantum Platform API token](/guides/functions-get-started) and select the quantum function as:\n"
msgstr "Sahkan diri anda menggunakan [token API IBM Quantum Platform](/guides/functions-get-started) anda dan pilih fungsi kuantum sebagai:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function sizes {#function-sizes}"
msgstr "Saiz fungsi {#function-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job runs at one size: `S`, `M`, or `L`. If the size is too small, the job is rejected. If it is larger than needed, the job runs on a bigger compute profile than the work requires. See [Function sizes](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes) for how sizes work in general.\n"
msgstr "Setiap job dijalankan pada satu saiz: `S`, `M`, atau `L`. Jika saiz terlalu kecil, job ditolak. Jika lebih besar daripada yang diperlukan, job dijalankan pada profil pengiraan yang lebih besar daripada keperluan kerja. Lihat [Saiz fungsi](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes) untuk cara saiz berfungsi secara umum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The size comes from two properties of your model: how many variables it has, and\n"
"how densely they interact, that is, the fraction of all variable pairs that appear together\n"
"in a term of the objective or of a constraint.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saiz ditentukan oleh dua sifat model anda: bilangan pemboleh ubah yang dimilikinya, dan\n"
"sejauh mana padat pemboleh ubah itu berinteraksi, iaitu pecahan semua pasangan pemboleh ubah yang muncul bersama\n"
"dalam satu sebutan fungsi objektif atau kekangan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Size | Smallest size for variables and interaction density | Compute profile | vCPU | RAM |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| `S` | At most 50 variables and density at most 0.1 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `M` | At most 100 variables and density at most 0.25 | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"
"| `L` | Either above the `M` bound | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Saiz | Saiz terkecil untuk pemboleh ubah dan ketumpatan interaksi | Profil pengiraan | vCPU | RAM |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| `S` | Paling banyak 50 pemboleh ubah dan ketumpatan paling tinggi 0.1 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `M` | Paling banyak 100 pemboleh ubah dan ketumpatan paling tinggi 0.25 | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"
"| `L` | Mana-mana melebihi had `M` | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A model must fit **both** bounds of a size, which is why a small but tightly coupled\n"
"model can be `L`: ten variables all coupled to each other is a density of 1.0. These\n"
"are the same bounds for every optimization function, so a size means the same\n"
"difficulty of model whichever one you call.\n"
msgstr ""
"Model mesti memenuhi **kedua-dua** had sesuatu saiz, itulah sebabnya model yang kecil tetapi berpasangan rapat\n"
"boleh menjadi `L`: sepuluh pemboleh ubah yang semuanya berpasangan antara satu sama lain ialah ketumpatan 1.0. Had ini\n"
"sama untuk setiap fungsi pengoptimuman, jadi satu saiz bermaksud\n"
"tahap kesukaran model yang sama tidak kira fungsi mana yang anda panggil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two things raise the density more than they appear to:\n"
msgstr "Dua perkara menaikkan ketumpatan lebih daripada yang disangka:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**A term over more than two variables couples every pair of them.** A term in\n"
"four variables contributes all six pairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Satu sebutan yang melibatkan lebih daripada dua pemboleh ubah memasangkan setiap pasangannya.** Satu sebutan dengan\n"
"empat pemboleh ubah menyumbang kesemua enam pasangan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**A constraint counts as the penalty that replaces it on hardware.** Squaring the\n"
"constraint couples every pair of variables in it, so a one-hot constraint over\n"
"four variables also contributes all six pairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Satu kekangan dikira sebagai penalti yang menggantikannya pada perkakasan.** Mengkuasaduakan\n"
"kekangan memasangkan setiap pasangan pemboleh ubah di dalamnya, jadi kekangan one-hot ke atas\n"
"empat pemboleh ubah juga menyumbang kesemua enam pasangan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default is `M`, used when a job does not request a size.\n"
msgstr "Lalai ialah `M`, digunakan apabila job tidak meminta saiz.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also read the mapping from the function itself with `function.sizes_map`, and the default size with `function.default_size`.\n"
"For the Parity Twine Optimizer, every variable that appears in `problem` counts once,\n"
"and every quadratic term such as `\"(0, 1)\"` contributes one pair. The model in the\n"
"[example](#example) has five variables and one of the ten possible pairs, a density\n"
"of 0.1, so it needs `S`. Fully connected models, such as the\n"
"[Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-sk) or the QUBO\n"
"form of the [market split problem](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), have a\n"
"density of 1.0 and always need `L`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga boleh membaca pemetaan daripada fungsi itu sendiri dengan `function.sizes_map`, dan saiz lalai dengan `function.default_size`.\n"
"Untuk Parity Twine Optimizer, setiap pemboleh ubah yang muncul dalam `problem` dikira sekali,\n"
"dan setiap sebutan kuadratik seperti `\"(0, 1)\"` menyumbang satu pasangan. Model dalam\n"
"[contoh](#example) mempunyai lima pemboleh ubah dan satu daripada sepuluh pasangan yang mungkin, iaitu ketumpatan\n"
"0.1, jadi ia memerlukan `S`. Model yang bersambung sepenuhnya, seperti\n"
"[model Sherrington-Kirkpatrick](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-sk) atau bentuk QUBO\n"
"bagi [masalah market split](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), mempunyai\n"
"ketumpatan 1.0 dan sentiasa memerlukan `L`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the size before submitting {#calculate-the-size-before-submitting}"
msgstr "Kira saiz sebelum menghantar {#calculate-the-size-before-submitting}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following calculator on your own model. It reads the model and nothing else: no job is submitted and nothing is reserved, so you can call it as often as you like while you reduce a model to a smaller size.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan kalkulator berikut pada model anda sendiri. Ia hanya membaca model dan tiada yang lain: tiada job dihantar dan tiada apa-apa ditempah, jadi anda boleh memanggilnya sebanyak yang anda mahu semasa anda mengecilkan model kepada saiz yang lebih kecil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the size is too small, the job fails with error `4600` and the message names the\n"
"size to use instead. If it is larger than needed, the job runs normally and records a\n"
"`4601` advisory event. See [Function sizes](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika saiz terlalu kecil, job gagal dengan ralat `4600` dan mesej itu menyatakan\n"
"saiz yang perlu digunakan sebaliknya. Jika lebih besar daripada yang diperlukan, job dijalankan seperti biasa dan merekodkan\n"
"peristiwa nasihat `4601`. Lihat [Saiz fungsi](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes) untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut.\n"

